&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Also, if you are a developer who likes MyPaint and also happens to like and work on Windows, your help with some of our windows-only bugs (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mypaint/mypaint/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;amp;q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3Awindows&quot;&gt;and there are quite a few&lt;/a&gt;) would be most welcome! There are also Windows-only issues related to the external-edit functionality that could be improved with input from an expert on how Windows handles default applications, application candidates and similar. These problems will unfortunately not fix themselves.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
